WEBVTT

00:05.500 --> 00:06.490
The Artifacts...

00:08.240 --> 00:11.800
The main branch commands that we steal the remaining Artifacts.

00:14.210 --> 00:17.940
And to continue to use
Drei for that purpose.

00:19.580 --> 00:23.180
What do you plan to do, Monado Aria?

00:24.150 --> 00:28.610
If it is written in the Black Book, then it must be done.

00:37.230 --> 00:42.540
Hey who are you thinking of now?

00:42.540 --> 00:50.470
I am thinking of you

00:53.080 --> 00:55.750
I felt it when I opened my window

00:55.750 --> 00:58.020
Ah the smell of the night

00:58.020 --> 01:00.590
Whose face did I just see

01:00.590 --> 01:02.890
In my heart?

01:02.890 --> 01:05.660
When I was

01:05.660 --> 01:07.900
Soaked by the cold rain

01:07.900 --> 01:09.560
You were the only one

01:09.560 --> 01:12.530
To reach out your hand

01:12.530 --> 01:17.370
Why are you always

01:17.370 --> 01:21.980
The one to support me

01:21.980 --> 01:24.910
Each time

01:24.910 --> 01:29.220
I fall deeper in love

01:29.220 --> 01:34.420
Hey no matter what I do I want to see you

01:34.420 --> 01:39.130
Falling in love hurts

01:39.130 --> 01:41.900
You are always the only reason

01:41.900 --> 01:44.430
I feel happiness and heartache

01:44.430 --> 01:52.340
I am thinking of you

01:55.240 --> 02:03.850
Hey I want to see you

02:08.260 --> 02:09.420
What?!

02:09.890 --> 02:12.130
Uh, um...

02:12.130 --> 02:15.330
Say that again, Yuichi.

02:15.330 --> 02:17.800
I'm glad you three are getting along.

02:17.800 --> 02:19.270
Before that!

02:19.270 --> 02:21.200
It looks like going along with Ohmi's plan,

02:21.200 --> 02:23.400
and staying together overnight, was worth it.

02:23.400 --> 02:26.110
W-Wait a second.

02:25.970 --> 02:29.310
A Time

02:25.970 --> 02:29.310
for Battle

02:26.110 --> 02:29.080
Wasn't that Lady Baba's order?

02:29.080 --> 02:30.310
That's right.

02:30.310 --> 02:32.680
Suguru came all the way to school to tell us.

02:32.680 --> 02:33.910
That was a lie.

02:34.480 --> 02:35.970
A-A lie?

02:36.620 --> 02:37.850
You deceived us!

02:37.850 --> 02:40.660
The end justifies the means.

02:40.660 --> 02:43.020
H-How can I say this?

02:43.020 --> 02:47.830
I thought that might have been the case.

02:47.830 --> 02:49.200
Liar!

02:48.630 --> 02:50.000
You definitely believed it!

02:50.000 --> 02:52.030
You had no idea!

02:52.030 --> 02:53.760
I knew the whole time.

02:54.540 --> 02:56.870
No, I don't think you did.

02:56.870 --> 02:59.770
W-Wait a second, Yuichi.

03:00.040 --> 03:04.080
Ohmi said you were the least suspicious,

03:04.080 --> 03:07.450
and the most gullible, Takuma.

03:17.060 --> 03:20.600
Now, about today's seal patrol.

03:20.600 --> 03:25.170
Shinji and I will start at the fourth seal, the bells.

03:25.170 --> 03:28.400
Afterwards we'll head to the fifth seal, the ring.

03:28.400 --> 03:29.470
Understood.

03:29.470 --> 03:30.460
Wait a second.

03:31.210 --> 03:35.270
They've figured out our stupid plan and we want to patrol as well.

03:38.710 --> 03:40.150
Wake up!

03:40.980 --> 03:43.280
Um, may I?

03:44.420 --> 03:49.880
During my recent patrols, I've been looking for the Logos' hideout.

03:50.290 --> 03:53.260
You've been searching the entire time, Shinji.

03:53.260 --> 03:58.170
I investigated a hunch, and I think I'm close.

03:58.570 --> 04:01.060
Will you let me see this through until the end?

04:02.300 --> 04:04.570
I already told this to Yuichi,

04:05.740 --> 04:08.080
but this is something I started by myself,

04:08.080 --> 04:10.550
so I want to do something about it by myself.

04:12.250 --> 04:13.480
Please.

04:14.750 --> 04:18.120
If you're willing to say all that, then I guess... Right?

04:18.120 --> 04:21.420
Right. Then, we're counting on you again today.

04:22.560 --> 04:24.890
So what should we do?

04:24.890 --> 04:27.960
We look after this one.
What choice do we have?

04:27.960 --> 04:29.490
What do you mean, "what choice do we have?"

04:51.920 --> 04:53.750
What's wrong, Vier?

04:54.260 --> 04:55.990
I thought you had called me.

04:58.860 --> 05:01.730
My mistake. Then I will...

05:03.130 --> 05:04.290
No.

05:05.200 --> 05:07.300
Put them away.

05:07.300 --> 05:08.460
Yes.

05:11.870 --> 05:13.670
I must do what I must do.

05:14.540 --> 05:18.710
As Monado, I cannot disobey the main branch.

05:22.320 --> 05:23.220
I'm starving.

05:23.220 --> 05:25.380
Me, too. Let's get something to eat.

05:31.590 --> 05:35.190
Wh-What do you want, sexual harasser?

05:36.330 --> 05:40.200
So the smell of the old Ugaya woman hasn't rubbed off on you yet.

05:40.200 --> 05:42.690
Huh? I don't know what you mean.

05:44.810 --> 05:47.170
I have no intention of listening to what you have to say.

05:49.610 --> 05:51.310
Have you ever been...

05:51.310 --> 05:52.510
betrayed?

05:55.950 --> 05:57.650
Be prepared.

05:58.320 --> 05:59.580
It'll be painful.

06:00.190 --> 06:01.420
What are you saying?

06:01.420 --> 06:04.190
You talk like you think I'm going to be betrayed by someone.

06:08.830 --> 06:11.200
I don't dislike your smell.

06:11.430 --> 06:13.090
It's just a warning,

06:13.470 --> 06:14.460
Tamayori princess.

06:14.970 --> 06:16.490
How do you know that?

06:18.210 --> 06:20.680
What do you want? Stay away from her.

06:21.080 --> 06:22.630
Takuma Onizaki...

06:23.780 --> 06:25.800
One of the incompetent guardians.

06:26.410 --> 06:27.580
What?

06:29.080 --> 06:30.520
Don't, Takuma.

06:36.220 --> 06:38.460
Hey, that hurts.

06:37.130 --> 06:38.460
If you're a guardian,

06:38.460 --> 06:40.030
don't leave her side.

06:38.590 --> 06:40.030
Let go, Takuma.

06:45.700 --> 06:48.100
That hurts. Let go, Takuma.

06:48.700 --> 06:49.970
I don't like it.

06:49.970 --> 06:52.530
What? Ryo Kutani?

06:53.510 --> 06:54.710
Now that you mention it,

06:54.710 --> 06:57.610
he knew that I was the Tamayori princess,

06:57.610 --> 06:59.410
and that you were a guardian.

07:00.080 --> 07:04.180
It's not like we're hiding that we're guardians.

07:07.220 --> 07:09.690
And we, the guardians, are always with you.

07:09.690 --> 07:13.220
You'd have to be an idiot not to know that you're the Tamayori princess.

07:14.230 --> 07:17.130
He asked me if I'd ever been betrayed.

07:17.130 --> 07:18.120
Huh?

07:18.630 --> 07:21.930
He said to be prepared.

07:23.470 --> 07:25.070
Don't let it bother you.

07:25.070 --> 07:27.770
He's just an onlooker trying to cause trouble.

07:39.920 --> 07:41.120
You get it?

07:41.760 --> 07:44.060
I-I get it!

07:45.060 --> 07:47.090
Don't yell at me.

07:47.530 --> 07:49.800
You were spacing out.

07:49.800 --> 07:51.290
I wasn't.

07:53.800 --> 07:57.100
Do you like that gray hair?
You have terrible taste.

07:57.100 --> 08:01.310
What? I have no idea what you're talking about.

08:01.310 --> 08:02.840
Hey!

08:02.840 --> 08:05.640
Weren't we meeting at the gate?

08:09.450 --> 08:10.320
Hey.

08:10.320 --> 08:11.290
Hello...

08:17.120 --> 08:19.790
What are you two doing? Fighting?

08:19.790 --> 08:20.930
Nothing.

08:20.930 --> 08:22.990
Th-That's right.

08:29.340 --> 08:30.700
You know,

08:31.540 --> 08:36.480
saying "nothing" or "nothing suspicious" is an obvious lie!

08:36.480 --> 08:38.380
What is it? What happened? Tell me!

08:38.210 --> 08:41.110
Kitamura Bread

08:39.550 --> 08:40.880
Here's your change.

08:41.320 --> 08:42.440
Thank you.

08:49.960 --> 08:53.390
Yakisoba sandwiches are one of
Japan's three greatest inventions.

08:53.390 --> 08:59.230
It's on me. Be grateful and eat up.

08:59.230 --> 09:00.170
Okay.

09:00.170 --> 09:02.200
Should I be grateful for this?

09:02.200 --> 09:03.430
Shut up and eat.

09:03.910 --> 09:06.140
Okay, thanks for the meal.

09:06.710 --> 09:09.980
Man, I'm protecting the
Tamayori princess,

09:09.980 --> 09:12.080
and even buying her a yakisoba sandwich.

09:12.080 --> 09:13.510
I'm the man.

09:14.250 --> 09:17.850
But compared to someone else, you might be right.

09:17.850 --> 09:21.360
I saved you when you were spaced out.

09:21.360 --> 09:23.790
I wasn't spaced out.

09:23.790 --> 09:28.700
I know, this is about Ryo Kutani, the famous futoukou-er.

09:28.700 --> 09:30.770
What's a futoukou-er?

09:30.770 --> 09:32.130
A school absentee.

09:32.870 --> 09:35.240
Why would you make that English?

09:35.240 --> 09:36.570
That wasn't English.

09:37.200 --> 09:39.710
Then just say it normally.

09:38.640 --> 09:41.070
I can't handle any more of these two.

09:41.740 --> 09:44.080
Anyway, pay no attention to his buzzing.

09:45.280 --> 09:50.180
We'll protect you, no matter what. Don't worry.

09:53.320 --> 09:54.310
Okay.

10:04.670 --> 10:05.970
This is pretty good.

10:05.970 --> 10:10.610
Really? I think taiyaki is more likely to be one of Japan's three greatest inventions.

10:10.610 --> 10:13.770
What?! Don't underestimate yakisoba sandwiches!

10:19.310 --> 10:20.340
What are you do-

10:21.480 --> 10:22.420
Tamaki!

10:30.730 --> 10:31.890
Are you all right?

10:32.530 --> 10:34.220
Hey, Tamaki.

10:34.760 --> 10:38.270
I can't... It's coming in...
Two of them...

10:38.270 --> 10:40.560
What? What'd she say?

10:41.470 --> 10:43.100
T-Two of them?

11:26.510 --> 11:28.180
So they're here.

11:28.180 --> 11:30.850
What's this, our fateful reunion?

11:30.850 --> 11:32.290
I can't say I'm thankful.

11:37.160 --> 11:40.030
Oni, demon of the orient.

11:41.060 --> 11:43.360
I'll take care of both of them.

11:43.360 --> 11:47.460
Hey, death god, your opponent is me.

11:48.370 --> 11:49.200
No!

11:49.570 --> 11:51.130
I won't let you two get involved.

11:53.670 --> 11:54.660
Tamaki!

11:58.080 --> 11:59.050
Are you all right?

11:59.050 --> 12:01.640
You can't fight. I'm still not...

12:03.450 --> 12:04.980
I'm sorry, Tamaki.

12:05.550 --> 12:06.890
I can't withdraw from this.

12:10.520 --> 12:13.890
Having stuff continually stolen from me isn't really my style.

12:15.900 --> 12:16.730
Hunt them.

12:27.610 --> 12:28.940
Yuichi!

12:28.940 --> 12:31.110
Yes, something just now...

12:31.110 --> 12:32.210
Watch out!

12:37.820 --> 12:38.840
Ohmi?

12:39.620 --> 12:40.850
Come out!

12:41.690 --> 12:43.660
I know you're there.

12:50.600 --> 12:51.770
How unexpected.

12:51.770 --> 12:56.070
What are you doing here, water user?

12:56.600 --> 12:58.810
You're all here, too.

12:58.810 --> 13:01.110
What happened to the internal strife?

13:02.210 --> 13:04.510
Let's end this quickly.

13:04.510 --> 13:06.950
Drei, this is the moment you've been waiting for.

13:08.320 --> 13:10.250
I am grateful to hear that.

13:10.250 --> 13:12.550
Then let's get right to it.

13:25.370 --> 13:27.130
Why do you hold back?

13:28.840 --> 13:31.270
You're more than this.

13:32.410 --> 13:33.870
Am I wrong?

13:39.280 --> 13:40.440
Takuma...

13:41.850 --> 13:44.250
What purpose does your strength serve?

13:46.450 --> 13:48.490
You have the strength...

13:48.490 --> 13:52.360
to destroy everything and to protect what must be protected.

13:52.360 --> 13:56.490
But you didn't use it that night.

14:01.100 --> 14:04.130
And now again.

14:06.070 --> 14:07.470
Shut up.

14:09.480 --> 14:13.140
Does uncontrollable power frighten you that much?

14:14.650 --> 14:19.610
Or are you afraid of becoming a monster?

14:20.920 --> 14:24.120
<i>Something strange is sleeping inside me.</i>

14:26.390 --> 14:29.530
<i>It's evil, and if it awoke,</i>

14:29.530 --> 14:32.300
<i>it would break everything precious to me.</i>

14:33.400 --> 14:35.640
<i>There's an Oni inside me.</i>

14:35.640 --> 14:37.660
<i>It's not a guardian.</i>

14:38.170 --> 14:40.210
<i>Sealed by the Tamayori princess,</i>

14:40.210 --> 14:42.510
<i>it's an Oni that will destroy the world.</i>

14:52.290 --> 14:54.020
Show me...

14:54.790 --> 14:56.220
your strength.

14:58.760 --> 14:59.990
Shut up!

15:12.310 --> 15:14.070
Pitiful.

15:14.440 --> 15:17.670
You cannot protect what is precious to you like that.

15:23.780 --> 15:26.410
Just try putting a hand on her.

15:28.160 --> 15:31.750
I'll kill you, Eins!

15:48.440 --> 15:51.210
That's right. That's better.

16:05.330 --> 16:07.290
What a delicious looking soul.

16:07.290 --> 16:11.320
Don't go around telling people they look delicious!

16:23.010 --> 16:25.100
You are in despair.

16:25.410 --> 16:29.470
Your soul has given up on living.

16:31.020 --> 16:32.920
Then why do you fight?

16:34.790 --> 16:37.520
You're contradicting yourself.

16:40.830 --> 16:42.590
You talk too much.

16:53.540 --> 16:55.440
You're more than that.

16:55.780 --> 16:57.110
You're more than that!

16:57.810 --> 16:58.740
Takuma!

17:06.890 --> 17:09.020
Not yet. Not yet.

17:09.020 --> 17:12.520
This isn't enough to awaken the monstrous blood inside you!

17:14.160 --> 17:15.630
It's still not enough!

18:23.160 --> 18:24.890
Pitiful Sybil,

18:29.700 --> 18:32.400
in time I will free you from your suffering.

18:34.140 --> 18:35.540
Aria...

18:39.650 --> 18:42.140
What happened to
Suguru and the others?

19:06.570 --> 19:08.440
It can't be...

19:09.310 --> 19:12.010
Don't worry. They're not dead.

19:13.850 --> 19:15.280
That's...

19:15.980 --> 19:17.420
That's...

19:21.660 --> 19:25.320
Tamaki, get down!

19:28.130 --> 19:31.620
Wind, rustling wind, blow it closed.

19:36.370 --> 19:39.100
Return to where you blew from.

20:00.230 --> 20:01.320
Eins.

20:03.260 --> 20:04.860
Don't let him interfere.

20:20.850 --> 20:22.250
Takuma!

21:03.420 --> 21:05.260
The seal is broken.

21:19.640 --> 21:21.730
<i>What is this?</i>

21:36.420 --> 21:40.430
From between the trees

21:40.430 --> 21:48.340
The evening sun spills onto this tree lined street

21:48.340 --> 21:53.840
Talking and laughing

21:53.840 --> 21:59.250
Mysteriously made me feel at ease

22:01.750 --> 22:08.060
Since the two of us met that day

22:08.060 --> 22:11.960
Through the time we have spent together

22:11.960 --> 22:21.960
This feeling has grown

22:25.410 --> 22:28.140
In order to protect you

22:28.140 --> 22:33.710
I am here right now

22:33.710 --> 22:39.620
You try to act strong

22:39.620 --> 22:44.360
But I will accept all your weaknesses

22:44.360 --> 22:47.190
No matter how small

22:47.190 --> 22:52.630
You can rely on me for anything

22:52.630 --> 22:59.900
If you trip I will catch you with these hands

23:10.550 --> 23:11.810
Onikirimaru...

23:36.210 --> 23:37.510
Honestly...

23:39.050 --> 23:44.850
You're so good at troubling me.

23:46.390 --> 23:50.620
I understand. I won't let you go home today.

23:51.260 --> 23:52.890
Be prepared.

23:56.130 --> 24:01.070
Next Time: The Power of Onikirimaru
